## Exact upstream dependency (root blocker)

`v2/backend/app/cli/v2_production_payload_freshness_refresher.py` lines 33–69 define `TARGETS` with only five descriptor families:

1. `v2_native_ingestors` → loop `v2_native_ingestors_live_loop`
