The three stale per-source descriptors are **not in TARGETS** and have **no corresponding `*_live_loop` module**. They are populated only by one-shot CLI invocations and therefore inevitably age past the 900 s threshold (`v2/backend/app/cli/public_payload_freshness_guard.py:14 DEFAULT_STALE_AFTER_SECONDS`).

