- `v2_market_ingestor`: missing `v2_market_ingestor_live_loop` module. Data plane is already covered by `v2_native_ingestors_live_loop` (pid 1381598, `--interval-seconds 60`, 165 `v2:market:*` Redis keys). Descriptor is effectively orphaned.
