## Why not "just stamp fresh"

CLAUDE.md *Evidence Integrity Rule*: summaries are not evidence. Overwriting `generated_utc`/`last_run_ts` without a recurring producer is a summary masquerading as live runtime evidence — it would be re-staled on every subsequent check, and it could falsely satisfy the public payload freshness guard / codex governor and unblock flows whose precondition is a live producer.

